# ============================================================
# BMS V1 .gitattributes
#
# CRITICAL: The Phase 3 validated baseline and all phase reports
# bind evidence to exact file BYTE hashes (SHA-256), and several
# referenced files (FreeRTOSConfig.h, SPL sources, build logs,
# map files) contain MIXED CRLF/LF line endings in the working
# tree. Any Git EOL conversion (core.autocrlf) would silently
# change those bytes and invalidate the evidence.
#
# Policy: store every file byte-for-byte as it exists in the
# working tree; never normalize line endings. Files not listed
# as binary keep text-diff capability (they are still stored
# exactly as-is thanks to the global `-text` rule).
# ============================================================

# Store all files exactly as-is (no CRLF/LF conversion, ever).
*               -text

# Explicit binary markers (no text diff, no conversion).
*.pdf           binary
*.o             binary
*.obj           binary
*.axf           binary
*.hex           binary
*.bin           binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.exe           binary
*.lib           binary
*.a             binary
*.d             binary
*.dep           binary
*.crf           binary
*.lnp           binary
*.lst           binary
*.htm           binary
